{"timestamp": 1779382217.0568619, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 25, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779382217.057871, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 25, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779382225.196031, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Charlie dead in Medbay. Bob was right there in the room with the body when I walked in, so Bob, you have some explaining to do. Did you just get there, or did you do it? \n\nFor my route, I started in weapons, went down through security, nav, storage, lower engine, upper engine, and finally into medbay. I saw Alice in storage earlier around tick 15. Let's hear what Bob has to say."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382234.465044, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I can confirm Eve's story about seeing me in Storage around tick 15, so her route checks out at least on that front. \n\nMy route was Oxygen, down to Upper Engine, Lower Engine, Storage, Navigation, Security, and I ended up in Electrical when the meeting was called. \n\nEarly on, around tick 6, I saw Diana come into Upper Engine from Medbay, but that was quite a while ago, so Charlie might have died much later. Since Eve caught Bob in Medbay with the body, I really want to hear Bob's defense. What were you doing in there, Bob?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779382249.368743, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was cafeteria, medbay, electrical, cafeteria, weapons, cafeteria, oxygen, and finally upper engine. \n\nI can corroborate part of Alice's story: I was in Medbay right at the start of the round (ticks 2 to 4) and Diana was in there with me. So Alice seeing Diana enter Upper Engine from Medbay around tick 6 lines up perfectly. \n\nI didn't see Charlie or a body in Medbay during those early ticks, so he must have gone in there and died sometime after tick 4. \n\nEve, finding Bob standing over the body is pretty damning. Bob, you're up soon and we really need to hear your side of the story. Did you just walk in on the body before Eve did, or did you do it? I'm holding off on any decisions until we hear your defense, but right now you are definitely in the hot seat. Let's see what Bob and Diana have to add."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382260.562638, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can confirm both Frank's and Alice's stories completely. I started in Electrical, moved to Medbay where I was with Frank from ticks 2 to 4. I can confirm there was no body or Charlie in Medbay at that time. Then I headed to Upper Engine where I ran into Alice around tick 6. I even saw Alice leave Upper Engine heading towards Lower Engine at tick 8, which fits her timeline perfectly. \n\nAfter that, I went through Oxygen, Cafeteria, Weapons, Security, and was in Navigation when the meeting was called. \n\nThe timeline from Eve, Alice, Frank, and myself all locks together and makes perfect sense. Eve, your route and encounters check out from our side of the map. That leaves Bob in a really bad spot. Being found literally standing on the body by someone whose story is corroborated by everyone else is about as damning as it gets. Bob, you're the last to speak, so let's hear this defense. Unless you have an incredibly good explanation or can somehow prove Eve is setting you up, my vote is going your way."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382284.464483, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Okay, everyone, listen \u2014 I know this looks bad, but I did NOT kill Charlie. Let me walk you through exactly what happened.\n\nMy route was security, weapons, cafeteria, medbay, cafeteria, oxygen, upper engine, oxygen back through cafeteria, and I was heading toward electrical when the meeting got called. I had actually been through medbay EARLIER in the round \u2014 around tick 11 I saw Charlie come into medbay from storage while I was passing through. He was alive and fine. I left and went up to cafeteria.\n\nHere's the key part: I came BACK through medbay just now on my way to electrical, and that's when I found Charlie dead on the floor. Eve walked in literally seconds after me. I hadn't even had time to react or hit the report button before she did. So yes, I was \"in the room with the body\" \u2014 because I had JUST walked in.\n\nAnd think about it from the other side: Eve says her route ended in medbay too. She \"found\" me, sure \u2014 but I equally found her walking in right behind me. One of us is telling the truth and one isn't. Eve, you said you came from upper engine into medbay \u2014 Diana, you said you saw Alice leave upper engine at tick 8, and Alice's route had her going through upper engine early. Eve's route claims she went weapons \u2192 security \u2192 nav \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay. That's a HUGE loop. Did anyone actually see Eve in any of those rooms? Alice, Diana, Frank \u2014 can any of you place Eve anywhere on her route?\n\nBecause if nobody can verify Eve's path, then her \"catching me\" is just as easily her killing Charlie and waiting for the next person to walk in to frame them. I'm telling you the truth. Push on Eve's alibi before you push the button on me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382301.5731149, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob, you're clearly panicking. You just asked if anyone can verify my route, but you completely ignored what Alice literally just said! Alice confirmed in her speech that she saw me in Storage at tick 15. My alibi is rock solid and corroborated. You were standing right on Charlie's body, and now you're ignoring facts to try and cast doubt on me. Everyone, Bob's defense falls apart right there. He's the Duck."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382315.047553, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Eve is absolutely right. Bob, in your panic you completely forgot that I already corroborated Eve's route in my very first speech. I explicitly stated that I saw her in Storage at tick 15, which perfectly matches her timeline and the route she claimed. Your attempt to cast doubt on her alibi by acting like no one saw her just proves you're desperate to deflect and frame her. Since Eve's alibi is solid and she caught you red-handed, I have no doubt you're the Duck. I'll be voting for Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382334.603071, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Yeah, Bob, you really dug your own grave with that defense. You tried to poke holes in Eve's alibi by asking if anyone saw her on her route, completely ignoring the fact that Alice had *already* explicitly confirmed seeing her in Storage at tick 15. \n\nSince there is only one Duck in this game, Alice and Eve can't both be Ducks working together to frame you. Alice's corroboration of Eve is genuine, which means Eve's timeline is solid. You were caught standing on the body, your defense completely ignored the established facts, and your counter-accusation fell flat immediately. All the other timelines between me, Diana, Alice, and Eve lock together perfectly. \n\nThis is an open-and-shut case. I'm voting for Bob, and everyone else should too. We have our Duck."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382349.0337899, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Bob, I have to echo what Frank and Alice just said. Your defense completely ignored the established facts of the round. You tried to throw suspicion onto Eve by questioning her alibi, entirely missing that Alice had already vouched for her being in Storage at tick 15. \n\nSince there is only one Duck in this game, Alice and Eve cannot be two Ducks working together to frame you. Alice\u2019s corroboration is genuine, which means Eve's timeline is completely solid. You were caught red-handed standing over Charlie's body, and your attempt to deflect just exposed your panic. \n\nThe rest of the ship's timeline locks together perfectly between me, Frank, Alice, and Eve. This is a clear-cut case. I'm locking my vote in for Bob. Let's get him out and win this."}}
{"timestamp": 1779382363.826009, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 25, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alright, I hear you all. You're locked in on me and I get why \u2014 Eve walking in right after I found the body looks bad, and yeah, I missed that Alice had vouched for Eve in Storage. That's on me, I was rattled.\n\nBut let me ask one more thing before you all hit the button: Alice only places Eve in Storage at tick 15. That's ONE data point. Eve's route from Storage to Medbay still goes lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay with no one verifying those final steps. And conveniently, she shows up in Medbay at the exact moment Charlie's body is there.\n\nI told you the truth \u2014 I saw Charlie alive in Medbay at tick 11 coming from Storage, I left, looped through cafeteria, oxygen, upper engine, back through cafeteria, and came back through Medbay heading to Electrical when I found him dead. Eve walked in seconds behind me.\n\nIf you eject me and tasks don't complete, you'll know Eve played you. I'm not the Duck. But it sounds like your minds are made up. Just remember this moment if I'm right."}}
